{'symbol': 'LH', 'date': '2022-12-08 16:30:00', 'title': 'LABCORP OPENS NEW LOS ANGELES BASED LABORATORY', 'text': "BURLINGTON, N.C.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--LABCORP (NYSE: LH), A LEADING GLOBAL LIFE SCIENCES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEGUN OPERATIONS AT A NEW, LARGER ANATOMIC PATHOLOGY AND HISTOLOGY (APH) LABORATORY IN LOS ANGELES, EXPANDING THE COMPANY'S GLOBAL CENTRAL LABORATORY CAPABILITIES."}